{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-quantum-observable-universe-exists","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:quantum-observable-universe-exists","kind":"proposition","title":"Existence of quantum observable universes","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/ex-qou-su2","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/ex-c-quantum-observable-universe"],"proofs":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prf-quantum-observable-universe-exists"],"cites":["references/woronowicz1987","references/woronowicz1988","references/reshetikhin1991","references/kassel1995","references/chari1994guide"],"tags":["existence","quantum-observable-universe","chern-class","reshetikhin-turaev","woronowicz"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.exists_instance","text":"quantum-observable-universe-exists.md","leanSource":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/quantum-observable-universe-exists.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:quantum-observable-universe-exists\"></a><p>Given a principal <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{SU}(2)</code>-bundle over a compact oriented manifold satisfying the measurability condition <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">c_1 = c_2 = 0</code>, there exists a quantum observable universe. Setting <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbf{C} = \\mathbf{Rep}(U_q(\\mathfrak{sl}_2))</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A = \\mathcal{O}_q(\\mathrm{SU}(2))</code>, and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\tau</code> to the forgetful functor realizes the axioms explicitly.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/quantum-observable-universe-exists.md","leanStatus":"proved","heading":"Proposition","number":"3.1.3"}
